{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんおはようございます. お疲れ様です !!\nまに or ろってぃ−です\\(*´ω｀*)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日は、横浜にて握手会でした.!!\nペアは仲良し ななせ○〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜ろてぃこ○。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせ大好き〜.♪.♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーになったらななせと絡む時間少なって、正直 少し寂しかったりもする (;_・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かれこれ ななせ,まひろのペアは４回目くらい..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会きてくださった, Rotty夢の皆さん\nななせ推しの皆さん,\n乃木坂推しの皆さん, ありがと〜う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、握手会の休憩時間の合間に\nワンフレーズの『のど自慢大会』を開催しました !!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私は 歐陽菲菲さんの〜ラヴ・イズ・オーヴァー〜を歌わせてもらいました.♪.♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたかね？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言っても いつものステージで歌ったわけでもなく、\n自分の方にスピーカーがなくて\n自分の声と音源が聴こえなくて、リズムとるので必死でしたけど、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、楽しかったです !\n場所,環境 関係なく歌えるだけで幸せです..*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださった皆さん、ありがとう！\n( 渋かったやろ？わら  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢香さんや福原美穂さんの曲を歌おうと思ってたんですけど、カラオケがなかったみたいで、\n急遽思い付いた曲が〜ラヴ・イズ・オーヴァー〜 でした 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラヴ・イズ・オーヴァー大好きなんです\\*^^*/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっっ ))))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんと二人で会ってきたよ〜.♪\n久しぶりに せっちゃんとの時間つくれた..*\n幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんとは 永遠の仲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晩御飯は うどん !!\n麺 1,5倍 増加してもらいました.* わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいちーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せそうな顔してる\\☆/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2014/07/21/7818930/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。のし。  まに or ろってぃ−"}],"source":"archive"}